Ocean emoji bitmaps in this folder are from the Noto Emoji project
(https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

They are used as per-instance Chatbox component icons because GDI / System.Drawing
cannot colour-render an emoji font to the Grasshopper canvas.

Files are named emoji_u<codepoint>.png (lowercase hex Unicode code point), e.g.
emoji_u1f30a.png for 🌊 (U+1F30A WATER WAVE).
